{"id":"HAD-1019","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Abū Saʿīd al-Ḫudrī رضي الله عنه berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"Die besten Sitzungen sind die **weitesten**.","source":"Sunan Abī Dāwūd","grade":"ḥasan","verificationNote":"100er-Schritt 951–1050; zweiter 20er-Ḥadīṯ-Unterblock."}